   "text": "Progress bar and counts are always in\nwords: Approved, In review, Stale,\nDisputed, Suggested. Every number is a\nbutton that applies that filter.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Progress bar and counts are always in\nwords: Approved, In review, Stale,\nDisputed, Suggested. Every number is a\nbutton that applies that filter.",
