   "text": "Saved views are the main navigation at\nscale. \"My queue\" is the default for a\nreviewer; \"Needs my lens\" shows clusters\nwhere your lens is required but not yet\nsigned.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Saved views are the main navigation at\nscale. \"My queue\" is the default for a\nreviewer; \"Needs my lens\" shows clusters\nwhere your lens is required but not yet\nsigned.",
